---
config:
  flowchart:
    defaultRenderer: elk
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: '"Noto Sans CJK SC", "PingFang SC", sans-serif'
---
flowchart TD
    Send["TX 路径：ip_finish_output2"]
    Lookup["neigh_lookup(arp_tbl,<br/>&nexthop_ip, dev)<br/>net/core/neighbour.c:625"]
    Found{条目存在？}
    State{neigh 状态？}
    None["无条目 → neigh_create"]
    Reachable["NUD_REACHABLE<br/>具有 dst_ha (MAC)<br/>最近的确认仍然有效"]
    Stale["NUD_STALE<br/>有 MAC，但已过期<br/>启动探测"]
    Incomplete["NUD_INCOMPLETE<br/>正在解析（已发送 ARP 请求）<br/>等待时将 skb 排队"]
    Failed["NUD_FAILED<br/>ARP 超时<br/>丢弃或生成<br/>ICMP 不可达消息"]
    BuildL2["使用 neigh->ha 构建<br/>以太网标头 (eth_header)"]
    Xmit["dev_queue_xmit"]
    Send --> Lookup --> Found
    Found -->|否| None --> Incomplete
    Found -->|是| State
    State -->|REACHABLE| Reachable
    State -->|STALE| Stale
    State -->|INCOMPLETE| Incomplete
    State -->|FAILED| Failed
    Reachable --> BuildL2 --> Xmit
    Stale --> BuildL2
    Reachable ~~~ Stale
    Incomplete ~~~ Failed

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class BuildL2,Xmit ok
    class Failed bad
    class Found,State hot
